| Linear Regression | Predict continuous values                 |
| Overfitting       | Model memorizes training data             |
| Ridge             | L2 regularization; shrinks coefficients   |
| Lasso             | L1 regularization; can eliminate features |

### What should you learn next?

I recommend this order:

1. Elastic Net Regression (combines Ridge and Lasso).
2. Multicollinearity.
3. Feature Scaling (StandardScaler and MinMaxScaler).
4. Cross-Validation.
5. Polynomial Regression.

**One important interview point:** Ridge, Lasso and Elastic Net are all regularization techniques. They don't change the basic objective of Linear Regression (predicting continuous values); they change how the model is trained to control complexity.
